      { title: "Lead disposition", text: "Label service need, geography, urgency, qualification, appointment status, sold outcome, and known revenue using a consistent process." },
      { title: "Channel attribution", text: "Separate organic search, Google Business Profile, paid search, LSA, social, direct, referral, and AI-assisted visits where the available systems allow it." },
